  "source_title": "Q3 Enterprise Product Feedback Session",
  "author": "Marcus Vance",
  "raw_text": "Meeting held on Oct 12. Discussed the rollout of the new billing module. Acme Corp reported a 45-minute delay in invoice reconciliation, which is unacceptable for their finance team of 12 people. Beta test latency improved by 18% after the caching update on server cluster B. Action items: Marcus needs to push the hotfix by Thursday 5 PM. Sarah will review error logs on Wednesday. We agreed to pause customer onboarding until the memory leak is patched."
